OL,3,GNEWSATraveller site set for rejection
OL,4,Aover rural impact
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a group of travellers to make
OL,7,Fa plot of land their permanent home are
OL,8,Fexpected to be turned down by
OL,9,Fcouncillors.
OL,11,FThe site at Saham Toney, near Watton in
OL,12,FNorfolk, had previously faced
OL,13,Fenforcement action from Breckland
OL,14,FDistrict Council after 23 caravans were
OL,15,Fmoved onto it.
OL,17,FLisa Jay, who has lived there for more
OL,18,Fthan 15 years, has since applied to
OL,19,Fturn the small plot into a permanent
OL,20,Fsite for 12 families.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
