OL,3,GNEWSATraveller site set for rejection
OL,4,Aover rural impact
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut council officers have raised
OL,7,Fconcerns about the impact on the
OL,8,Fcountryside, and are advising the
OL,9,Fplanning committee to reject the
OL,10,Fproposal when they meet next Tuesday.
